msgstr "Tetapkan parameter yang telah dioptimalkan dan ambil sampel distribusi akhir menggunakan primitif Sampler.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/quantum-approximate-optimization-algorithm/extracted-outputs/2989e76e-4296-4dd8-b065-2b8fced064cf-0.avif)\n"
msgstr "![Output dari sel kode sebelumnya](/docs/images/tutorials/quantum-approximate-optimization-algorithm/extracted-outputs/2989e76e-4296-4dd8-b065-2b8fced064cf-0.avif)\n"

