msgstr "![Output dari sel kode sebelumnya](/docs/images/tutorials/quantum-approximate-optimization-algorithm/extracted-outputs/650875e9-adbc-43bd-9505-556be2566278-0.avif)\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
